                                    Ủy nhiệm chi 
                                </span>
                                <div style="position: absolute;right: 0;left: 220px;top: 37px;text-align: center;">
                                    <span style="margin-bottom: 0px;font-size: 12px">Payment Order</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-3 text-right" style="display: flex; justify-content: right; align-items: center; padding: 0 40px 0 0 ;">
